id: pm-5dwz1a
title: "GHSA-2v37-7h3g-55p8: pin patched nanoid in the Vite/PostCSS development graph"
description: "A fresh pnpm audit reports the high-severity nanoid custom-generator infinite-loop advisory through the development-only @codspeed/vitest-plugin -> Vite -> PostCSS graph. The advisory's patched floor advanced after the original fix, making 3.3.17 vulnerable. Raise the repository override floor to patched 3.3.18 without broadening unrelated dependency updates, then prove the complete dependency and quality inventories clean."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[5]: dependencies,release-gate,scorecard,security,vulnerability
