completed_at: "2026-08-13T19:08:19.083Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "nanoid resolves to patched 3.3.18 or newer within the compatible 3.x line; pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities; full lint, typecheck, build, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, package acceptance, and security gates pass"
parent: pm-qwoy
severity: high
resolution: "Raised the compatible nanoid 3.x security floor to 3.3.18 after the advisory contract advanced, eliminating GHSA-2v37-7h3g-55p8 without unrelated dependency churn."
expected_result: The resolved dependency graph contains no vulnerable nanoid release; pnpm audit and repository security gates report zero vulnerabilities while all SDK/CLI quality and coverage gates remain green.
actual_result: "The workspace override and installed graph resolve the sole nanoid instance to patched 3.3.18; a fresh post-lock audit reports zero known vulnerabilities, exact coverage passes 100/100/100/100, and all lint/static/SDK/measurement/package gates pass."
